+/// Upstream's buttons to RustDesk's own pages: a message box's [JumpLink] to `link` (the core's
+/// and a peer's messages link only to RustDesk's docs: HELPER_URL, LOGIN_ERROR_MAP,
+/// SCRAP_X11_REF_URL) and the Wayland keyboard prompt's "Why this happens" (an issue on RustDesk's
+/// GitHub). A pinned build is not RustDesk's app and offers neither, as it shows no "Powered by
+/// RustDesk"; [pinned] is the links' pinned-server flag (hjviewer_access.dart).
+bool hjvOffersRustDeskPage(String link, {required bool pinned}) =>
+    !pinned && link.isNotEmpty;
